@startuml organization-boundary
title Organization Boundary ; per ADR-ES-022 section 11

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Organization" as Org
class "Enterprise" as E
class "Process" as P
class "Activity" as Act
class "Capability" as Cap
class "Value Stream" as VS
class "Operations" as Op
class "Agent" as Ag

Org -[dotted]- E : is NOT
Org -[dotted]- P : is NOT
Org -[dotted]- Act : is NOT
Org -[dotted]- Cap : is NOT
Org -[dotted]- VS : is NOT
Org -[dotted]- Op : is NOT
Org -[dotted]- Ag : is NOT

E -[dotted]- Org : is NOT
P -[dotted]- Org : is NOT
Act -[dotted]- Org : is NOT
Cap -[dotted]- Org : is NOT
VS -[dotted]- Org : is NOT
Op -[dotted]- Org : is NOT
Ag -[dotted]- Org : is NOT

note right
  Per ADR-ES-022 section 11 (Rejected Interpretations):
  Organization is NOT Enterprise, Process, Activity, Capability,
  Value Stream, Operations, or Agent. Reverse direction also rejected.
end note

@enduml
